      "instance_name": "hateful_irony",
      "label": "hateful ironic expression",
      "description": "The emotion expressed is a form of hateful irony, where the juxtaposition of religious piety (praying) with extreme, violent, and sexually charged accusations (beheading enemies, marrying little girls) is used to mock Islamic religious practices and cultural norms. The tone is deliberately provocative and mocking, aiming to ridicule and dehumanize Muslims by framing their religious devotion as hypocritical or barbaric.",
